OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighter back home after week
OL,4,Ain critical care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA firefighter has returned home after
OL,7,Fspending nearly two weeks in hospital,
OL,8,Fincluding a week in critical care,
OL,9,Ffollowing a huge blaze in
OL,10,FStoke-on-Trent.
OL,12,F"Although this is a positive step, he
OL,13,Fstill has a journey of recovery ahead
OL,14,Fand will continue to be supported by
OL,15,Fthe service," a spokesperson for
OL,16,FStaffordshire Fire and Rescue said.
OL,18,FThey said six firefighters were taken
OL,19,Fto hospital after responding to the
OL,20,Fincident in Sandyford on 13 August,
OL,21,Fwith five of them being discharged soon
OL,22,Fafterwards.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
